      "zh": "耶和华如此说：扶助埃及的也必倾倒。埃及因势力而有的骄傲必降低微；其中的人民，从色弗尼塔起（见二十九章十节）必倒在刀下。这是主耶和华说的。",
      "en": "“‘This is what the Lord says:Egypt’s supporters will fall;her confident pride will crumble.[NOTE:1] From Migdol to Syene[NOTE:2] they will die by the sword within her, declares the Sovereign Lord.",
